==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] can help a fair bit here, but you will need multiple and they are vulnerable to the Aku. [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] is a good source of damage, but they can be vulnerable to Aku Gory, so bring multiple Meatshields. Additionally, do your best to kill the first Dark Otter before triggering the boss, as you won't want to be dealing with any more of them than is strictly necessary. 

